# Normalize line endings. Everything text is stored as LF in the repo and
# checked out with your platform's native endings. This stops CRLF-vs-LF
# "phantom" conflicts no matter what committed a file (your editor, the
# GitHub web UI, a tool). Takes precedence over core.autocrlf.
* text=auto

# Binaries: never run line-ending conversion on these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
